{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本三重縣伊勢志摩有「海女之鄉」美譽，亦是目前現役海女的主要聚居地。</p><p>當地有獨家平台推出體驗行程，於英虞灣與海女下潛，欣賞徒手捕撈海產絕技；</p><p>再到伊勢市品嘗時令食材炮製的會席料理，並玩轉志摩市豪華露營冒險樂園，一於來個深度食玩遊！</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.339201+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.996066+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.996066+00:00","content_hash":"85fc4387860f4c3f45a5a99aa810f823d79d55fb6941a97d5c02c11acbc32fef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}